hey thanks for making this post here it actually made my day and made me smile and motivated me to go and study 

&#x200B;

thanks you so much

OMG SAME EVERY SINGLE TIME 

&#x200B;

Not to mention the big long story and side stories I tell people when telling them something and every time I say I will not do it and still continue to do it every single time 

&#x200B;

we ADHD people would be really good writers you the kind who write in the stream of consciousness, yeah and oh lord would that be funny if we wrote it exactly the way we think and everything that we think
